==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[line]] of [[sight]]|lines of sight}}

# A straight line along which an observer has a clear view.
# {{context|weaponry}} The line which passes through the front and rear [[sight]], at any [[elevation]], when they are [[sighted]] at an object.

